                    <span><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Rupee Cost Averaging:</strong> Buy more units when NAV is low, fewer when high.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="text-growth mt-0.5 font-bold">✓</span>
                    <span><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Power of Compounding:</strong> Reinvesting returns exponentializes growth over 10–20+ years.</span>
